Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Added TGBUILD compile hooks to Swift and ObjC sources.

---
 .../TelegramApi/Sources/TLObjectSupport.swift | 12 ++++++
 .../Sources/Network/Network.swift             | 41 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../DocumentCanvasView+EditMenuActions.swift  |  3 ++
 .../Sources/TabBarComponent.swift             |  3 ++
 .../TranslateUI/Sources/TranslateScreen.swift |  3 ++
 .../UIKitRuntimeUtils/UIBarButtonItem+Proxy.h |  7 +++-
 .../Sources/WebProxyDiagnostics.swift         | 21 ++++++++++
